  "text": "## Risk Appetite Statement in Practice  \n### Risk Decisions  \n**Decisions Consistent with Risk Appetite:**\n- ✅ Account opening with strong KYC, quality screening\n- ✅ Mortgage lending with affordability checks, reasonable LTV\n- ✅ Conservative pricing (competitive, not predatory)\n- ✅ Investment in compliance and fraud systems\n- ✅ Capital retention for stability and growth  \n**Decisions Inconsistent with Risk Appetite:**\n- ❌ High-risk lending (commercial loans, high LTV mortgages)\n- ❌ Aggressive growth (sacrificing control/compliance)\n- ❌ Regulatory shortcuts or violations\n- ❌ Concentrated customer exposure (>10% capital)\n- ❌ Excessive leverage or capital risk\n- ❌ Weak controls or inadequate staffing",
